    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yolamu kūbilinga mabità",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yolamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahabu ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'īnaane go būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoshafati ū ntemi wa Yuda; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī alī mu Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; gwike ītī gīt'ūmo baalī bīītīla a ba ise nū nina. Ū wei akalyīnja ī liwe lya ng'wa Baalī, īlo walī walībeeja ū ise kūlwa kwilamilīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo naheene akikala adimanile nū būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabeenhelaja Baisilaeli kūwīta; atalekanile nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Mesha wa Moabu walī nsabi wa ng'holo; na lūūlū walī wahelelwa kūyūtwala būlī ng'waka ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli baana ba ng'holo shihūmbī igana, hamò na booya bo ng'ondi ja ng'holo shihūmbī igana līmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Ahabu aho waacha, ū ntemi wa Moabu ūlema ū kwikala alī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wa ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Yolamu wīnga ī Samalia, ūja akūbayeelelaga pye a Baisilaeli akūbabilingaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū kūlī Yehoshafati ū ntemi wa Yuda ūtūma nhūng'wa alīhaya, “Ū ntemi wa Moabu wanigomelile, kinehe, ūdūgije ū kūja hamò nane ū kwilwisha būlūgū nang'hwe ū ntemi wa Moabu?” Ū Yehoshafati ūshosha alīhaya, “Nakūja hamò nang'ho, nguno ū nene nalī gīt'ūmo ūlī ū bebe, a banhū bane balī bako, nī falasa jane jilī jako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūbūūja, “Alīyo ūlū tūlīja tūkūbītīla nzīla kī?” Ūshosha, “Tūkūbītīla nzīla ya kwitogolo lya Edomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Isilaeli nū ntemi wa Yuda būja hamò, būmītīla nū ntemi wa Edomu. Būbīta nzīla ya kwipīndīīla, būmala shikū gītī mpungatī gīko, būbona batī na minzī ga kūng'wa a boi nī ndamhī jabo nī mitugo ījo baalī najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūkumya alīhaya, “Mhayo kī nago ū gwenūyū! Ū SEEBA hū watūkumingile hamò batemi būdatū wise kwiza kūdūtūūla mu makono ga ntemi wa Moabu gete?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoshafati ūbūūja, “Atīho ng'hangibo ng'wa SEEBA ū kūūnū tūmūje ū SEEBA kūbītīla mulī we?” Ūmò wa bataale ba bashilikale ba Isilaeli ūhaya, “Ū ng'wenūmu alīho Elisha ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafati, ūyo walī ngunanhi o ng'wa Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati ūhaya, “Ū ng'wenūyo alī nago ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA.” Na lūūlū a batemi būdatū wabo, ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, nū Yehoshafati nū ntemi wa Edomu, būja ū kūlī Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishosho lya ng'wa Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūnshokeja ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, “A ha gatī yako ū bebe nū nene būlīho būsangī kī? Angū jaga ū kū bahangi ba ng'wa so, na a bahangi ba ng'wa noko.” Alīyo ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūshosha, “Ītī chene, nguno ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo watwitanile a bise batemi būdatū wise; gashi nīyo kwiza kūtūtūūla dūhū mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Moabu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elisha ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA wa būdūla bose alī mpanga, ūyo nalī ntūmami wakwe, ūlū ni ītī kūng'winha ikūjo Yehoshafati ntemi wa Yuda, ū bebe ni natakūlolile, nūūlū kwibona nang'ho dūhū yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha ī yenīyo yashilaga, nenhelagi ndono.” Ū ntūji wa ndono aho wandya kwītūla, ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Elisha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ī sī ya ntubīlo yenīyī yokajagi machongo machongo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī: Mutūbona nyaga nūūlū mbula, alīyo ī sī ya ntubīlo yenīyī īkokala minzī; na lūūlū mukūng'wa a bing'we benekīlī nī mitugo jing'we, nī ndamhī jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū ū kūlī SEEBA gūlī nogu no; nīyo nū ntemi wa Moabu akūntūūla mu makono ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwīkenaagūla pyī ī mizengo īyo īpīndīlījiwe ndugu, nī mizengo mitaale ī yose. Mukwībbutagūla pyī ī mitī ī yawiza, nī nzwinzī ja minzī ī jose mukūjikandīīla; na a malaale a gawiza pye a gose mukūgookaja mawe gakenaagūke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ha ntondo yaho makanza ga kūfunya shitambò, kwimanīla minzī gaaseesa gizile kūfuma kū magūlya ga Edomu; ī sī yookala minzī pa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yolamu kwilwisha būlūgū na Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Moabu aho bigwa gīkī a batemi benabo bizile kūbadumīla balwe būlūgū nabo, bikobya pye abo baalī badūgije kūbūūcha shilanga, kwandīja bado, pye na a banamhala; būyoolela shilanga būūkihela kū lūbīmbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamisha ī dilū būgabona a minzī gakūlabangīlaga kūlwa nguno ya līīmi; a bana Moabu bagaloleelaga a minzī ū kūfuma ū kū ntambūko gwabo galī gaaza gītī mininga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būhaya, “Bing'we mininga gete a genaya; tambala machimu a batemi benabo bikenyaga bitandagūla shū. Alilūūlū bana Moabu, tūjagi kūdima nding'wa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bana Moabu aho bashika ū kū ng'hambī ja Baisilaeli, a Baisilaeli būpuluka kūlwa nabo būlūgū, kūshisha būpeela. A Baisilaeli bingīla ū mu sī ya Moabu būbabūlaga banhū bingī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo bīkenaagūla, na a malaale a gawiza būgookaja mawe pye a gose gūkenaagūka, nguno būlī munhū waaponejaga mawe moi. Pyī nī nzwinzī ja minzī būjikandīīla, nī mitī yawiza pyī ī yose bībbutagūla. Gūsaaga nzengo gwa Kili-haleseti dūhū ūyo mawe gago gataholomolilwe; naheene nū gwene bigela banhū ba nhaago būyūgūponda mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Moabu aho wabona gīkī ū būlūgū wandidohela, ūsola banhū magana mpungatī bamani ba kūlwīla shū, gīkī alītwinye ī libità lya bashilikale, aje akibone nū ntemi wa Edomu; alīyo ūlemeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
